39:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"If your phone supports eSIM, a travel eSIM bought before you fly lets you land already connected and skip the kiosk entirely. Roaming on your home SIM also works but is usually the most expensive way to use data. Whichever you choose, check that your phone is unlocked if you plan to use a Saudi SIM."}]
